    "detailed_description": "<h1>Latest News</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814090/extras/053be51ba164f1758524ce9de29f738c.avif?t=1746790017\" width=722 height=262 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO COMING SOON</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Be part of shaping this game!<br></li><li> Join our upcoming open demo and provide feedback.<br></li><li> Add A Good Night\u2019s Rest to your wishlist to be notified when the first demo drops!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters from your subconscious by night and the struggles of young adulthood by day in this turn-based tactical mental-health cozy horror RPG to get... A Good Night's Rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814090/extras/22daade464004d98ac9a0969bde7c40d.avif?t=1746790017\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER YOUR FEARS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Start university far from home? Tough. Add in nightmares disrupting your sleep? Even tougher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Push back subconscious monsters by making friends, honing strategies, and upgrading abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lasting resilience comes from facing your deepest anxieties, whether in climactic boss battles or daytime revelations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814090/extras/dd80e77b816f81dfa84914854a977ef1.avif?t=1746790017\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR MENTAL HEALTH</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > School's demanding, time's scarce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skipping class to catch some Zs might make you feel Rested, but it could spike your Anxiety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every daytime choice impacts your nighttime battles, so choose wisely.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FRIENDSHIP TAKES WORK</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Meet a diverse cast, each with their own stories and backgrounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your interactions carefully\u2014flirt, fight, or fall in love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your decisions shape not only your world but also the dreamscape and your companions\u2019 stories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814090/extras/a803806da98efc40145abb2fb12dce1b.avif?t=1746790017\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE NIGHT</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can't just defeat your nightmares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dying wakes you up, and running won't help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use newfound friendships and mental abilities to hold off the terrors until dawn.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VIVID HAND-DRAWN ADVENTURE</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Traditional artistry and animation bring the cozy college setting to life by day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rich environmental storytelling reveals fantastical landscapes and terrifying creatures by night.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ORIGINAL MUSIC BY LEFT AT LONDON</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie Pop singer-songwriter Left at London\u2019s music has brought her worldwide acclaim and has previously been featured in games including <i>Fortnite</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Left at London brings her unique style to this game with an original soundtrack across multiple genres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Let her electrifying melodies set the tone for your journey.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters from your subconscious by night and the struggles of young adulthood by day in this turn-based tactical mental-health cozy horror RPG to get... A Good Night's Rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814090/extras/22daade464004d98ac9a0969bde7c40d.avif?t=1746790017\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER YOUR FEARS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Start university far from home? Tough. Add in nightmares disrupting your sleep? Even tougher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Push back subconscious monsters by making friends, honing strategies, and upgrading abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lasting resilience comes from facing your deepest anxieties, whether in climactic boss battles or daytime revelations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814090/extras/dd80e77b816f81dfa84914854a977ef1.avif?t=1746790017\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR MENTAL HEALTH</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > School's demanding, time's scarce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skipping class to catch some Zs might make you feel Rested, but it could spike your Anxiety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every daytime choice impacts your nighttime battles, so choose wisely.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FRIENDSHIP TAKES WORK</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Meet a diverse cast, each with their own stories and backgrounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your interactions carefully\u2014flirt, fight, or fall in love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your decisions shape not only your world but also the dreamscape and your companions\u2019 stories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814090/extras/a803806da98efc40145abb2fb12dce1b.avif?t=1746790017\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE NIGHT</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can't just defeat your nightmares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dying wakes you up, and running won't help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use newfound friendships and mental abilities to hold off the terrors until dawn.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VIVID HAND-DRAWN ADVENTURE</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Traditional artistry and animation bring the cozy college setting to life by day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rich environmental storytelling reveals fantastical landscapes and terrifying creatures by night.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ORIGINAL MUSIC BY LEFT AT LONDON</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie Pop singer-songwriter Left at London\u2019s music has brought her worldwide acclaim and has previously been featured in games including <i>Fortnite</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Left at London brings her unique style to this game with an original soundtrack across multiple genres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Let her electrifying melodies set the tone for your journey.</p></li></ul>",
